# Frontend Architecture

## Overview

The PanjoCoin frontend is planned as a modular web application designed to provide access to ecosystem information and future decentralized services.

## High-Level Structure

Frontend
│
├── Home Page
├── Ecosystem Dashboard
├── Documentation Portal
├── Token Information
├── Community Section
└── Future dApp Modules

## Planned Modules

### Home

Project overview and ecosystem introduction.

### Dashboard

Token metrics and ecosystem statistics.

### Documentation

Access to Whitepaper, Tokenomics, Roadmap, Security Policy, Legal Disclaimer, Architecture, and Charity documents.

### Community

Links to official social media and community channels.

### Future dApp

Wallet integration and ecosystem interaction tools.

## Design Principles

* Transparency
* Accessibility
* Security
* Simplicity
* Scalability

## Future Expansion

The architecture may evolve to support staking, governance, analytics, and treasury modules.
